ow you can!\n\nThanks to Mixed Reality and Miracle Pool, you can place a virtual Pool Table in your home, walk around, and shoot some balls. You can also play against friends or against other online players.\n\nThis is a room-scale-only experience and you must have plenty of space to use it. The minimum recommended play area is 3m x 4m (10 feet x 13 feet)\n\nFEATURES:\n- Practice alone (8Ball, 9Ball, 10Ball, practice drills)\n- Play against computer (8 Ball)\n- Play with friends (up to 4 players, no rules enforced)\n- Play ranked matches against random online opponents for ELO points (8 Ball)\n\nNOTE:\nThis is an early access version, and we reserve the rights to change pricing and feature sets.", "short_description": "Your own virtual Pool Table in Mixed Reality."}]}, "developer_name": "Pixel Works", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pxlworks.io/mrpt_pp", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pixel Works", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pxlworks.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "5796340213802765"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1368299804106049"}]}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1697061360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1368299804106049"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"l